                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "indie game where you traverse mazes, avoiding traps and using weapons to explore passages to find the exit\n\n✅Mines, bombs, and other traps require caution. Even seemingly safe corridors can prove dangerous\n\n❌Repetitive mechanics: Obstacles are resolved in the same way; there's no variety\n❌Each level follows the same formula: find a path, avoid traps, find an exit. There are no new mechanics that change the gameplay\n❌The environment is undiversified; corridors quickly start to look the same\n❌The game isn't worth the money\n❌The soundtrack is very weak\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [b] Bad [/b], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url] \n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
